tag\">Beautifully Reimagined</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether playing in Full HD, TV or on ultrawide 21:9 displays, Monument Valley looks better than ever with stunning full-screen panoramic artwork. With more perceptible visuals than ever before, what secrets will you uncover?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every World Included</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monument Valley is the total collection of all Monument Valley content - with every chapter, add-on and DLC to make this the ultimate game to add to your collection. Inspired by minimalist 3D design, optical illusions, and ancient architecture from around the world, every monument is a unique, hand-crafted world to explore.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Panoramic Collection Out Now</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Monument Valley: Panoramic Edition and Monument Valley 2: Panoramic Edition </i>are both available at an exclusive bundle price when purchased together on Steam. The Panoramic Collection is the best way to play the Monument Valley series - with every chapter and DLC included.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927720/extras/446422c55e38c15ba3c96e3a89079a7e.poster.avif?t=1753190152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927720/extras/446422c55e38c15ba3c96e3a89079a7e.webm?t=1753190152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927720/extras/446422c55e38c15ba3c96e3a89079a7e.mp4?t=1753190152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927720/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0a56eec39745f43b.poster.avif?t=1753190152\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927720/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0a56eec39745f43b.webp?t=1753190152\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land\u2019s End, Assemble with Care and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure.</strong></p>",
